# Daily Log Module Rules

- **Feature Directory:** Live feature folder is `src/app/apps/jaxfr/features/daily-log/`.
- **Naming:** Do NOT create a sibling `daily-checklist` feature. Historical mentions of "Daily Checklist" refer to this module.
- **Regression Playbook:** Regression script is stored at `daily-log.regression.md` inside the feature folder.
- **Testing Cleanliness:** After running regression tests, ensure test records (e.g. `[TEST] DL`) are cleaned up.
